        <mxCell id="EyT6oF-ovBxys-f1xOxE-25" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;OPTIMISED GROUND SEGMENT FRAMEWORK FOR EFFICIENT PROCESSING OF&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;COPERNICUS SENTINEL-2 DATA STREAMS&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The proposed framework enables real-time satellite telemetry ingestion through FPGA-accelerated decoding combined with a distributed microservice pipeline. By offloading frame validation to hardware and leveraging a message-driven processing architecture, the system significantly reduces end-to-end latency while supporting elastic scaling across processing nodes. The design ensures high data freshness, fault isolation, and seamless integration with large-scale analytics and AI platforms, forming a robust foundation for next-generation Earth observation missions.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="555" x="-360" y="-330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zbvoaHkvpSs7XJc97ERu-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#990000;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Satellite Transmitter&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;498&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;318&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;283&quot; data-end=&quot;318&quot;&gt;Creates a fake image (checkerboard)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;322&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;Converts image pixels into compact binary format&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;402&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;402&quot;&gt;Splits the data into packets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;403&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Adds a header (metadata)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;Simulates packet loss&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Writes the transmitted stream to a file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;500&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;That file (&lt;code data-start=&quot;511&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;raw_stream.bin&lt;/code&gt;) represents what a real satellite would transmit over RF.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;500&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;828&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Image size = 256 × 256 pixels&lt;br data-start=&quot;859&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Each packet carries max 512 bytes&lt;br data-start=&quot;897&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 5% of packets are randomly dropped&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;500&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;940&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;So you’re simulating:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;a camera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;limited packet size&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;noisy space transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="470" x="-360" y="-40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FLQxsfm0ZKUBVexxL3yo-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#CC6600;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Ingest Service&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;303&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;Reads validated packets from FPGA (or simulated stream)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;362&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;Parses header + payload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;386&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;389&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Optionally verifies CRC again&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;419&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;Serializes packet into message format&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot;&gt;Publishes to Kafka&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;482&quot; data-end=&quot;515&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;485&quot; data-end=&quot;515&quot;&gt;Handles backpressure &amp;amp; retries&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="360" x="280" y="-60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FLQxsfm0ZKUBVexxL3yo-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999900;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Receiver Service&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;394&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot;&gt;Search for SYNC word (&lt;code data-start=&quot;419&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;0xABCD&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;Read header fields&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;454&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;Read payload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;495&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;470&quot; data-end=&quot;495&quot;&gt;Compute CRC32 in hardware&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;496&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;499&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;Compare CRC&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;511&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;Assert &lt;code data-start=&quot;521&quot; data-end=&quot;535&quot;&gt;packet_valid&lt;/code&gt; if correct&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="240" x="100" y="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FLQxsfm0ZKUBVexxL3yo-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="Ingest Service" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="90" x="535" y="162.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FLQxsfm0ZKUBVexxL3yo-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="Ingest Service" vertex="1">
